Firmware from Armada
Source: https://github.com/armada-os/armada, commit 384ac7c03194a839edcecc5cc55628217bac621b,
system_files/usr/lib/firmware/qcom/sm8750/ayn/odin3portal/{adsp.mbn,adsp_dtb.mbn}

Files in this package taken from it (under /usr/lib/firmware):
  qcom/sm8750/ayn/odin3portal/adsp.mbn and adsp_dtb.mbn (ADSP firmware, out of the AYN Odin 3
  Portal's Android)

These are proprietary firmware images, not Kettle Linux's or Armada's own work: they come from
the device's vendor (AYN) and its chip vendor (Qualcomm), as Armada collected them for its
images. The repository states no licence for them, and the files carry no licence text of their
own.

Status: redistribution permission from the rights holders has NOT been recorded for Kettle
Linux. They are shipped pending that permission; this file grants no rights of any kind.
